direction: down
title: OAuth 2.0 PKCE Flow

SPA: Browser SPA (React / Mobile)
IdP: Authorization Server (Keycloak / Auth0)
Backend: Spring Backend Resource Server

SPA -> SPA: 1. Generates code_verifier & code_challenge (S256)
SPA -> IdP: 2. GET /authorize with code_challenge { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
IdP -> SPA: 4. 302 Redirect with ?code=AUTH_CODE_123 { style.stroke: "#F59E0B" }
SPA -> IdP: 5. POST /token (code + code_verifier) { style.stroke: "#C084FC" }
IdP -> IdP: 6. Computes SHA256(verifier) == code_challenge
IdP -> SPA: 7. Returns Access Token (JWT) { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
SPA -> Backend: 8. GET /api/profile (Bearer JWT) { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
Backend -> SPA: 9. Returns Protected Profile { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
